    "message": "feat(mcp): expose structured output for JSON-backed tools\n\nReturn parsed JSON objects as structuredContent for ix_map, ix_ingest, and\nix_smells — the tools whose --format=json output is a verified object — with\nan object outputSchema that deliberately asserts only \"an object\" so backend\nfield drift cannot break tool calls. The human-readable text result is\npreserved for clients that prefer it. Pro tools stay text-only because their\ncommand implementations live in the separate @ix/pro package and their output\nshape cannot be verified from this repository.",
